3
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:19,320
For those of you that grew up in church, I'll let you feel comfortable this morning.

4
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,940
And I will say he is risen.

5
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:23,160
Amen.

6
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,920
Thanks so much for joining us.

7
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:29,160
We are humbled and honored that you are here this morning.

8
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:33,260
If you are new to Canvas, you haven't been here in a while, we are a young church plant.

9
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:43,580
We say all the time that we are a church of people with real lives, real people with real lives who are just looking at God's word together and seeking to follow Jesus together.

10
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:48,700
